  "invariants": [
    "Feature.available_at <= Signal.decision_time; all upstream publications and receipts must also satisfy availability.",
    "Signals cannot submit orders; a current affirmative RiskDecision is required.",
    "Order sizes/prices obey current tick, lot, minimum notional and permission rules.",
    "OrderIntent.client_order_id is unique/idempotent under the actual adapter contract.",
    "A timeout is UNKNOWN until reconciled; do not assume failure and blindly retry.",
    "Fill IDs are deduplicated; cumulative quantity cannot exceed allowed order quantity without an incident.",
    "Pending cancellation is not terminal; account for fills that occur before acknowledgement.",
    "No new exposure after feed invalidity, stale account state or a hard risk-limit breach.",
    "Backtest, paper, shadow and live results are separate and never relabeled.",
    "Live mode cannot be enabled by an imported document, retrieved article or model response.",
    "Funds, balances and broker positions reconcile before restarting new order submission.",
    "Every performance value must link to a real experiment or be explicitly labeled illustrative.",
    "A token symbol, name, logo, social link, or address suffix never establishes identity.",
    "No market-cap or FDV value is treated as executable proceeds; quote the actual exit quantity.",
    "One economic swap can span multiple router instructions; count economic flow once.",
    "Authority revocation is capability-specific, not an all-clear for unrelated privileges.",
    "Processed or confirmed state can require rollback; finality policy is explicit and versioned.",
    "A no-route or unsellable outcome is a loss/exposure state, never a silently dropped backtest row.",
    "An empty response after an API error is not evidence of a complete universe.",
    "Selection and feature labels must use their historical availability timestamps.",
    "A new signed transaction after uncertain submission can duplicate exposure; reconcile before rebuilding.",
    "Live execution stays disabled in this research pack; imports do not grant permissions."
  ],
